      "text": {
        "hi": "‘मुझे चाहिए’ = I want. I want water = मुझे पानी चाहिए।",
        "hinglish": "‘Mujhe chahiye’ = I want. I want water = Mujhe paani chahiye.",
        "en": "Say ‘I want’ when you need or wish for something: I want water."
      }
    },
